note right of AudioOutputDevice
  One QAudioSink at a time — playTestTone()
  and startStreaming() (issue #70, push-mode
  for a live call's remote audio) share it,
  starting either stops whatever was playing
  before it. finished() isn't emitted for a
  streaming session's idle-between-writes
  state, only for playTestTone()'s buffer
  actually draining.
end note
