note right of AudioInputDevice
  start() calls QCoreApplication::checkPermission()/
  requestPermission() (QMicrophonePermission) before
  startCapture() — Qt never shows the macOS prompt on
  its own for an Undetermined status.

  pcmDataAvailable() (issue #70) carries the same
  raw buffer levelChanged() computes from — lets
  CallManager forward real microphone audio into a
  call without this class knowing about calls at all.
end note
